{"id":"n14111-1-8","stage":4,"title":"염려 · 顾虑","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n14111-1-8-1","ko":"오늘 오후까지 해야 하는 숙제는 다 했어?","zh":"今天下午之前要完成的作业都做完了吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"오늘","meaning":"今天，今日","explanation":"오늘：今天，今日","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68206","senseId":"1","lemma":"오늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"오후까지","meaning":"下午，午后","explanation":"오후：下午，午后；까지：表示终点或范围：“到、直到、连……都”。","readings":[{"term":"오후","audio":"/audio/7575a29f7d674595d2a0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67457","senseId":"1","lemma":"오후","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"해야","meaning":"表示前面动作非常有必要或希望成为该状态。","explanation":"하다：表示前面动作非常有必要或希望成为该状态。；어야：表示必要条件；与 하다/되다 合用表示“应该、必须”。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62888","senseId":"3","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하는","meaning":"应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）","explanation":"하다：应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62888","senseId":"4","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"숙제는","meaning":"作业","explanation":"숙제：作业；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"숙제","audio":"/audio/b33db886cc66d3923b91.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65226","senseId":"1","lemma":"숙제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다","meaning":"全，都","explanation":"다：全，都","readings":[{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58175","senseId":"1","lemma":"다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"했어?","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"wo